Chaitin (spill on stuck):
  stuck; spill s outright (degree 4)
  simplify p (degree 2 < 3)
  simplify q (degree 1 < 3)
  simplify r (degree 1 < 3)
  simplify t (degree 0 < 3)
  select t: color 0
  select r: color 1
  select q: color 0
  select p: color 1
  result: 1 spill(s)
Briggs (optimistic):
  stuck; push s anyway (degree 4)
  simplify p (degree 2 < 3)
  simplify q (degree 1 < 3)
  simplify r (degree 1 < 3)
  simplify t (degree 0 < 3)
  select t: color 0
  select r: color 1
  select q: color 0
  select p: color 1
  select s: color 2
  result: every node colored, no spills
